OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to grow food on public land  
OL,4,Awins support                           
OL,6,FA councillor has suggested reviving    
OL,7,Fwartime spirit by growing fruit and    
OL,8,Fvegetables on disused public land.     
OL,10,FBen Green, a Reform UK member of South 
OL,11,FKesteven District Council (SKDC), said 
OL,12,Fthe idea would help the country should 
OL,13,Fit face food supply issues.            
OL,15,F"I think we do need to be more         
OL,16,Fresilient, so the greater amount of    
OL,17,Ffood that we can grow in a community   
OL,18,Fsetting on our doorsteps, I think is an
OL,19,Fabsolute no-brainer," he said.         
