OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to grow food on public land  
OL,4,Awins support                           
OL,6,FFellow councillors backed Green's      
OL,7,Fmotion to identify potential sites for 
OL,8,Fgrowing food, but the idea will face   
OL,9,Ffurther scrutiny before a final        
OL,10,Fdecision on whether to go ahead.       
